## Description

This pull request aims to enhance the app by implementing key features such as main navigation routes, database setup, and the addition of new announcements feature

## Tasks: 

- [x] implement main routes: Home, Residents, Announcements
- [x] configure MySQL db and integrate Prisma for model migration 
